WEBVTT

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.410
ORIGINAL WORK BY RENSUKE OSHIKIRI

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.880
What are you looking at?

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.090
Go to sleep.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.830
Go to sleep, would you?

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:19.930
Sleep!

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.240
Come on. Go to sleep, would you?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.650
We've got a big competition tomorrow,

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:32.910
so we both need the sleep.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.920
Why do you keep staring at me?

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:40.790
I'm going to sleep!

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.860
What did you do that for?

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.000
Why are you acting like this?

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.030
Cut it out, darn you!

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:57.840
You...

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.240
really are pretty.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.870
Ono...

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.280
I... don't know where to put my left hand.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.520
That hurts!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.220
Why did you bite me?

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.860
Darn you! That hurt!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.930
What's with that triumphant grin
on your face?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.400
<i>Hurry up and go to sleep!</i>

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:05.040
<i>That hurts! I told you not to bite me!</i>

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:11.210
<i>-Tiger Uppercut!
-Dosukoi!</i>

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.620
<i>-Yoga Flame!
-Shoryuken!</i>

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.290
<i>SUPER STREET FIGHTER II TURBO</i>
NATIONAL TOURNAMENT

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:21.790
The time has come again

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:26.060
for the <i>Super Street Fighter II Turbo</i>
National Tournament!

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:32.070
The preliminary round is
made up of Block A to Block K.

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:35.870
Each block is a single elimination bracket
with eight competitors.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:38.910
The big question is,

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.750
who will be among the 12 victors
who reach the finals?

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:46.850
As usual, this MC is full of nonsense.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.920
Whoa! The sparks are already flying
in the Block A competition!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.390
What's the matter?
Can't you see the screen?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.760
Fuck off!

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.660
If you make him defend, he can't counter!

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.060
He countered!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.030
Turtling allowed. Baiting allowed.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.470
These "anything goes" rules are
such garbage.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.270
And just look at the championship prize.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.910
Not another bath set?

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.250
It's impossible to get motivated.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.680
This is all your fault.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.550
Thanks to you, I hardly slept a wink.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.090
You tickled and bit the heck out of me.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:34.360
You kept waking me up,
but you yourself got some shuteye.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.000
What? You hardly slept a wink either?

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.740
<i>You big fat liar! You slept like a baby!</i>

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:50.480
We're certainly not in our best condition,
but the competition has already begun.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.950
Just get up there and fight to
the best of your ability like always.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.090
I'm in Block C, right up front.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.690
You're in Block F, right, Ono?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.520
Okay.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:06.890
See you in the finals.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.280
<i>Ono...</i>

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.280
<i>Focus on your matches!</i>

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.850
<i>Win your block in the prelims
so you can face Ono in the finals</i>

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:34.120
<i>and settle this!</i>

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.530
<i>Sonic Boom!</i>

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.530
He pulled it off!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.630
That was a Flying Buster Drop!

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.300
The winner is Haruo Yaguchi!

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.340
He's showing off his stuff
again this time!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.210
<i>That's one down.</i>

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.340
HARUO YAGUCHI

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:55.080
<i>I'll win my block with three victories.</i>

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.850
<i>I've already won dozens of times
in arcades.</i>

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:00.680
<i>All I have to do here is
win three in a row.</i>

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:06.690
<i>Guile, lend me your power again this time!</i>

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.730
<i>Like before,
you want me to just use my Sonic Boom?</i>

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.830
<i>No. Not that, please.</i>

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:15.360
It's been a while.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.930
We met before at the Osaka tournament.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.900
It's Kato from Hokkaido!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.670
<i>Just you watch!</i>

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:26.670
<i>Just you watch!</i>

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:27.840
<i>Just you watch!</i>

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.850
Last time, you defeated me in a flash,
but that won't happen this time.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.120
My skills are far greater than last time!

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.580
Just you watch!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.220
The winner is Yaguchi!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.790
-Kato was defeated in two straight fights!
-I'm so ticked off!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.860
Kato gets another chance in
the consolation round.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:52.000
I'll face anyone weaker than me!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:59.310
Yaguchi, your final opponent is
an Osaka local who uses Thunder Hawk,

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.710
Yamada!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:06.410
I'll knock your brains out
with my Condor Dive.

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.280
<i>Just one more win.</i>

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:13.150
<i>Just one more win
and I'm through the prelims.</i>

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.930
<i>Damn!</i>

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:21.230
Your shots won't work on me!

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.070
No way am I letting some high school brat
using Guile defeat me!

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.240
I'll crush you with ease!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.670
Yamada explodes with amazing moves!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.180
Yaguchi's in a bind!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.580
Will round one end
with Thunder Hawk continuing to

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:40.080
take command and controlling the fight?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.680
<i>If I lose in the prelims,
everything will be wasted!</i>

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.150
<i>All the work I've put into this!</i>

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.290
<i>My self-respect and pride!</i>

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:53.630
<i>And my feelings for Ono!</i>

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.230
I've got you now!

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.100
What?

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.910
<i>I've still got my match against her
ahead of me!</i>

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:09.010
<i>There's absolutely no way
I'm letting this end here!</i>

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:13.380
An eight-hit Double Somersault Kick?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:17.050
He pulled off <i>Super Street Fighter II</i>'s
most difficult move at a tournament!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:21.360
Yaguchi makes an amazing comeback
from a precarious position

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.160
to win the first round!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.360
Damn this punk!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.000
I'll win the rest of the rounds!

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:32.870
<i>There's no way I'm losing to anyone
who doesn't want to lose!</i>

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.710
<i>I am Haruo of the Mighty Fingers!</i>

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.280
The winner is Haruo Yaguchi!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.680
He brilliantly made it through Block C!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.520
He's made it through to the finals!

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:52.720
Goddamn it!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.760
<i>Somehow, I survived.</i>

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:01.730
<i>How is Ono doing in Block F?</i>

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.970
KEN OKAYAMA, AKIRA ONO

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.670
<i>It's so unlike you</i>

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.610
<i>to lose in your first match.</i>

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:51.310
<i>The lights in the Astro City
in your heart have gone out.</i>

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.550
<i>Is it because of
last night's distractions?</i>

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.360
<i>Or...</i>

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.630
<i>has Ms. Moemi's pronouncement
shaken your nerve?</i>

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.500
<i>You're pitiful!</i>

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.930
<i>How dare you let distracting thoughts
keep you from fighting properly!</i>

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:16.300
<i>Why have you come here?</i>

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.070
<i>It wasn't</i>

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:22.010
<i>just to watch others play, was it?</i>

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.150
<i>You came to show him
your feelings for him,</i>

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.580
<i>didn't you?</i>

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:36.820
<i>Will you turn your match with that girl
into a meaningless victory?</i>

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.040
<i>I know that you...</i>

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.570
<i>can burn bright again!</i>

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.180
<i>Reignite...</i>

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.850
<i>your fighting spirit!</i>

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.650
<i>Your passion from the past.</i>

00:12:05.520 --> 00:12:09.520
<i>Your proud, invincible, daredevil self!</i>

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.460
<i>That boy is waiting to see
that girl again!</i>

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.770
<i>As a gamer...</i>

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.070
<i>live up to your potential!</i>

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.240
<i>Go! You are...</i>

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:30.340
<i>the Crimson Cyclone!</i>

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.020
<i>Before leaving Japan,</i>

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:40.650
<i>take all your regrets
and everything else...</i>

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.590
<i>and pulverize them!</i>

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.510
<i>What was the point of
all my effort and determination?</i>

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:01.410
<i>What an unbelievable turn of events.</i>

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.040
<i>And after I desperately fought to survive.</i>

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.880
<i>My objective has evaporated.</i>

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.420
KEN OKAYAMA, AKIRA ONO

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.120
<i>Without Ono...</i>

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.390
<i>this tournament is meaningless.</i>

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.460
That Zangief is awesome!

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:18.090
She's freaking badass!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.100
She did it!

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:30.770
Ono blows away Kato in the first match
of the consolation round!

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.840
I just can't dance to this beat!

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:37.340
<i>Ono!</i>

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:42.780
Ono's next opponent is Ito who uses Akuma!

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.760
<i>I'll burn her to a crisp.</i>

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.230
<i>I'll just keep burning her up
with my Shakunetsu Hadoken.</i>

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.070
He got brown Ryu!

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.870
Unbelievably, it's the second time
in a row Ito screwed up in getting Akuma.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.780
Let me try it again!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.680
Let me try it again!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.450
You know we can't.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.280
Let me try it again!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.250
Let me try it again!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:27.960
Holy shit!

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:29.330
A standing Screw Piledriver!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.770
She did it! He has blown his top now!

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.400
Ono pulled it off!

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:39.410
She wins the second match
like a raging bull!

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:42.380
Let me try it again!

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.680
It's the final match of
the consolation round.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.250
If Ono can win this match,

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.790
she'll be like a phoenix
rising out of the ashes!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.390
This match will settle her fate!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.590
It's a surprise Rolling Attack!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.690
But Ono blocks it brilliantly!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.630
It's another Rolling Attack!

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.900
Will we see the human vacuum cleaner?

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:15.210
There it is! That's how to finish!
With a Screw Piledriver!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.810
I totally thought I was going to win
that bath set this time!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:21.650
The glorious victor of
the consolation round is...

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:26.420
the Goddess of the Fight, Akira Ono!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:32.360
<i>That determination!</i>

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.600
<i>Nobody has ever come close!</i>

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.400
<i>Her bloodthirsty attitude...</i>

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.600
<i>has returned!</i>

00:15:41.470 --> 00:15:43.200
<i>Ono is back!</i>

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.310
<i>Okay! The finals have finally begun!</i>

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:51.780
Twelve stalwart fighters have
made it through the brutal prelims!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.250
The first match of the finals is

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.680
Matsumura using Dictator

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.450
versus Yaguchi using Guile!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.030
<i>Just like I knew you could, Ono.</i>

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:09.060
<i>You clawed your way back up
from the bottom.</i>

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:15.140
At Kato's earnest request, from here on,
he'll be assisting with the commentary.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.740
Kato, tell us who you think will win this.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.310
I have to see with my very own eyes

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.940
-how these better players--
-Whoa!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:25.710
Yaguchi is already throwing a move!

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.420
<i>There's no way I'm losing either!</i>

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.350
<i>As a fighting game gamer!</i>

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.360
<i>In fact, as a man!</i>

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:48.070
He pulled it off!
A nine-hit Double Somersault Kick!

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:51.940
This puts Yaguchi into the semi-finals!

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.060
HARUO YAGUCHI, AKIRA ONO

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.690
<i>I'll meet Ono...</i>

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:12.460
<i>in the semi-finals.</i>

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.860
Ono is putting on quite a show too!

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.740
Can you believe this glowing beauty
just threw a five-hit Banishing Flat?

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:28.640
Ono only needs to win
one more to get to the semis!

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:33.950
<i>You can do it, Ono!</i>

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.450
<i>Make it through this to battle against me!</i>

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:42.220
But facing Ono this time is Urasawa
who uses Sagat!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:46.190
This guy's one tough opponent.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.690
<i>Tiger!</i>

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:51.700
Urasawa's Tiger Shot has Ono
in a tight spot!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.740
Sagat bests Zangief seven-to-three.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.300
She's at a huge disadvantage--

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:59.940
Ono has pushed Sagat to
the edge of the screen!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.310
A bite attack?
Why don't you use the Screw Piledriver?

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.520
-A bite cross-up!
-No way!

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:15.720
Ono's persistence has
paid off with victory!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:20.460
She's showing us the Zangief combo
that ends with a quick death!

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:24.470
She has done it!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:30.370
What a comeback!
After a nightmare loss in her first match,

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.770
she has made it magnificently
to the semi-finals!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.940
She's not just the Goddess of the Fight!

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:39.410
She's the real Crimson Cyclone!

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:41.350
<i>She did it!</i>

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.450
<i>I'll face Ono...</i>

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.550
<i>at this big event!</i>

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.700
<i>Ono's her usual self.</i>

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.000
<i>But she seems...</i>

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.040
<i>more imposing than usual.</i>

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:08.880
<i>She's so close... but far away.</i>

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:13.410
<i>She's just as unapproachable
as she was back then!</i>

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.690
<i>Her emotional attitude must have
changed a lot in just a short time.</i>

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:27.390
This semi-final round match is between

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.500
Haruo Yaguchi

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.070
and Akira Ono!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.000
I remember them!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:40.870
Those two battled it out
in the final in Osaka two years ago!

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.280
Seriously? It must be fate!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.480
<i>Finally...</i>

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:49.620
<i>We're finally here!</i>

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.590
<i>It's the decisive battle...</i>

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.020
<i>between me and Ono!</i>

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.870
This is going to be wild!

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:15.310
<i>Ono...</i>

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:20.310
<i>At first, I hated your guts.</i>

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.120
<i>You were infuriating.</i>

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.790
<i>You were disgusting to me.</i>

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:29.820
<i>But...</i>

00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:33.590
<i>now...</i>

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.840
<i>I love you to death!</i>

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.410
Standing Screw Piledriver
right off the bat!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.780
She's on fire!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.380
<i>Guile wins the Zangief matchup
nine-to-one.</i>

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.990
<i>Even with Zangief
at such a huge disadvantage,</i>

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:03.690
<i>Ono can blow me away with consummate ease!</i>

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:10.900
Hey! Guile is getting stomped!

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:14.200
This is totally against the odds!

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:17.900
<i>Once I'm forced to the edge of the screen
and have to defend,</i>

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:19.370
<i>it's practically over!</i>

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:27.550
The first round goes to Ono.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.750
It was over in no time!

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:31.950
Yaguchi couldn't do a thing!

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:34.250
<i>That's pretty damn good, Ono.</i>

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:37.220
<i>You're coming in for the kill
at full throttle, aren't you?</i>

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.160
<i>That's the real Ono!</i>

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:42.000
<i>But now you've asked for it!</i>

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:47.170
<i>I'll show you that
Guile can crush Zangief ten-to-zero!</i>

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.500
<i>That's the spirit, Haruo!</i>

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:50.640
Guile!

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.170
<i>One word of advice.</i>

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.110
<i>Sure!</i>

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.440
<i>Sonic Boom!</i>

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.150
<i>You're stronger for every Sonic Boom
you've launched until now!</i>

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:04.020
<i>Knock her on her tail, Haruo!</i>

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:39.850
<i>My favorite car is the Testarossa.</i>

00:23:39.910 --> 00:23:42.020
<i>It can go up to 293kph!</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.350
<i>I started at Mizonokuchi!</i>

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:45.490
<i>How much time is left?
There's no time to spare!</i>

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:49.190
<i>No matter what stage I'm at,
I keep the pedal to the metal!</i>

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:50.920
<i>The finish line is...</i>

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:53.090
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
